{#
    The attributes of the element around a screen whose answers are shown in place
    (assets/controllers/data_import_answers_controller.js, docs/features/data-import/pairing-screens.md "Answers in
    place"): every `<form data-import-answer>` inside is sent by the script - the tapped button shows it is working and
    can not be tapped twice, the answer is put where it belongs without the page moving, and an answer that could not
    be saved leaves everything as it was, with a short message. Without the script the forms are plain forms.
#}
data-controller="data-import-answers"
     data-data-import-answers-failed-value="{{ 'data_import.in_place.failed'|trans }}"
     data-data-import-answers-working-value="{{ 'data_import.in_place.working'|trans }}"
